# Bot1 Bolts Bot2's Gaddock Teeg (legendary green-white 2/2 Kithkin Advisor, {G}{W}); Starscourge exiles it and makes a token copy
# "except it's a 5/5 black Demon" (CR 707.9b): it keeps the name, the mana cost (mana value 2) and the legendary supertype, but it
# is black INSTEAD of green and white, and a Demon instead of a Kithkin Advisor, and 5/5. It copies the printed abilities too, so
# its Teeg ability applies: the token also restricts noncreature spells of mana value 4 or more (not tested here). Ardyn himself is no Demon, so has no keywords.

